# Copy to .env.local and fill in — see docs/supabase.md §9 and docs/deployment.md.

# FastAPI backend base URL (apps/api). Defaults to http://localhost:8000 if unset.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Supabase project — publishable/anon values only, safe for a browser bundle (RLS enforces
# access control server-side regardless of what this key can see).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://irhnoilyaqgewfidhunx.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_rThsO5r97_EqobhVt73jbg_ia0UGAnd

# Mobile V1 monetization (AdMob rewarded predictions) — all four optional. Unset in local/dev by
# design: RewardedAdService (frontend/src/lib/ads/) falls back to Google's own published test IDs
# when these are empty, which is the correct thing to ship whenever real ones aren't configured
# (Google's policy requires test ads in that case). AdMob App/ad-unit IDs are public identifiers,
# not secrets — safe in a browser bundle same as VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY above — but a real
# production value should still only be set in the native release build's environment, not here.
# See docs/mobile_admob_configuration.md for exactly what's required and where to get it.
# VITE_ADMOB_ANDROID_APP_ID=
# VITE_ADMOB_IOS_APP_ID=
# VITE_ADMOB_ANDROID_REWARDED_AD_UNIT_ID=
# VITE_ADMOB_IOS_REWARDED_AD_UNIT_ID=
